      "question": "二分类 Matthews 相关系数（MCC）如何由混淆矩阵计算？",
      "answer": "MCC = (TP×TN−FP×FN) / √[(TP+FP)(TP+FN)(TN+FP)(TN+FN)]。",
      "explanation": "其中 TP、TN、FP、FN 是混淆矩阵四种计数；分母为零时需按实现约定处理。",
      "example": "对高度不平衡的恶意样本检测补充报告 MCC。",
      "tags": [
        "MCC 分类评估",
        "二分类MCC公式"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://scikit-learn.org/1.7/modules/model_evaluation.html#matthews-correlation-coefficient"
    },
